---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Disclaimer — Greedy Growers Hub" description="Fan-site, accuracy, and source disclaimer for Greedy Growers Hub." canonicalPath="/disclaimer" noindex>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-leaf-400">Independent fan site</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-.04em] sm:text-5xl">Disclaimer</h1>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-8 leading-7 text-sand-300">
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-sand-100">No affiliation</h2><p class="mt-3">Greedy Growers Hub is an independent player resource. It is not endorsed by, operated by, or affiliated with Roblox Corporation or the developers and publishers of Greedy Growers. Roblox and related marks belong to their respective owners.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-sand-100">Information can change</h2><p class="mt-3">Game values, codes, mechanics, player counts, and availability can change without notice. We label evidence and review dates where practical, but the live game and its official Roblox page remain the final authority.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-sand-100">No guarantee of results</h2><p class="mt-3">The calculator performs arithmetic using the values you enter. It does not predict random events, guarantee profit, access your Roblox account, or automate gameplay.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-sand-100">Corrections</h2><p class="mt-3">If a record is wrong, prepare the page URL, disputed value, capture date, and a public source or in-game screenshot. See the <a class="text-leaf-400 underline" href="/contact/">contact page</a> for the current submission status.</p></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
